<title>SRI LANKA: Cricket-Sri Lanka declares at 350-8 v Zimbabwe.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Sri Lanka declares at 350-8 v Zimbabwe.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka declared their first innings closed at 350 for the loss of eight wickets on the third day of the second cricket test against Zimbabwe on Friday.</p>
<p>Zimbabwe first innings 141 all out. Sri Lanka 350 for eight declared.</p>
